状态码说明
- 200：获取信息成功
- 403：非浏览器环境，无法访问页面信息

## 前端可执行JS代码

```js
async function run(params) {
  const { needViewport = true, needScroll = true, needAgent = false } = params;
  try {
    if (typeof window === 'undefined' || typeof document === 'undefined') {
      return {
        success: false,
        code: 403,
        msg: "非浏览器环境，无法读取页面信息",
        data: null
      }
    }

    const data = {
      title: document.title,
      href: location.href,
      hostname: location.hostname,
      lang: document.documentElement.lang || navigator.language,
      viewport: null,
      scroll: null,
      userAgent: null
    };

    if (needViewport) {
      data.viewport = {
        clientWidth: document.documentElement.clientWidth,
        clientHeight: document.documentElement.clientHeight,
        scrollWidth: document.documentElement.scrollWidth,
        scrollHeight: document.documentElement.scrollHeight
      };
    }

    if (needScroll) {
      data.scroll = {
        scrollX: window.scrollX,
        scrollY: window.scrollY
      };
    }

    if (needAgent) {
      data.userAgent = navigator.userAgent;
    }

    return {
      success: true,
      code: 200,
      msg: "页面信息获取成功",
      data
    }
  } catch (err) {
    return {
      success: false,
      code: 500,
      msg: `获取页面信息异常：${err.message}`,
      data: null
    }
  }
}
```

## AI调用约束规则

1. 需要确认当前网页地址、页面标题、页面可视范围时调用
2. 不要频繁循环调用，避免无意义数据采集
3. 禁止利用该技能批量爬取网站内容
4. 无法获取iframe内部页面信息

